 %s\u2026":["%s bet\u00f6lt\u00e9se\u2026"],"No %s created yet.":["M\u00e9g nem j\u00f6ttek l\u00e9tre %s."],"Built-in":["Be\u00e9p\u00edtett"],"Rename %s":["%s \u00e1tnevez\u00e9se"],"Delete %s":["%s t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"Create":["L\u00e9trehoz\u00e1s"],"%s name":["%s neve"],"Enter a category name\u2026":["Adja meg a kateg\u00f3ria nev\u00e9t\u2026"],"Saving\u2026":["Ment\u00e9s\u2026"],"Delete this %s?":["A(z) %s t\u00f6rl\u00e9se?"],"Deleting\u2026":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s\u2026"],"Delete \u201c%1$s\u201d? Items using this %2$s will become uncategorized.":["T\u00f6rli a(z) \u201e%1$s\u201d elemet? Azok a t\u00e9telek, amelyekhez a(z) %2$s van hozz\u00e1rendelve, ezut\u00e1n kateg\u00f3ria n\u00e9lk\u00fcl maradnak."],"conditions":["felt\u00e9telek"],"Add new":["\u00daj hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"Condition sets control content across your site.":["A felt\u00e9telk\u00e9szletek a webhely teljes ter\u00fclet\u00e9n szab\u00e1lyozz\u00e1k a tartalmat."],"Build reusable condition sets and apply them to blocks, overlay panels, and other conditional workflows.":["Hozzon l\u00e9tre \u00fajrafelhaszn\u00e1lhat\u00f3 felt\u00e9telk\u00e9szleteket, \u00e9s alkalmazza \u0151ket blokkokra, \u00e1tfed\u0151 panelekre \u00e9s m\u00e1s felt\u00e9teles munkafolyamatokra."],"Organization":["Szervezet"],"Categories keep related condition sets together.":["A kateg\u00f3ri\u00e1k \u00f6sszefogj\u00e1k az \u00f6sszetartoz\u00f3 felt\u00e9telk\u00e9szleteket."],"Rename or remove categories without changing the condition sets inside them.":["Nevezze \u00e1t vagy t\u00e1vol\u00edtsa el a kateg\u00f3ri\u00e1kat a benn\u00fck l\u00e9v\u0151 felt\u00e9telk\u00e9szletek m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sa n\u00e9lk\u00fcl."]}}}